    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-prov6">
        <head xml:id="gom-prov6-Hd1e98">Caput 6</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov6-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov6-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_1@1-2">Fili mi.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e109"><seg type="qs">Litteraliter patet</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">teipsum prius necesse est, quae dixeris, custodire.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov6-Dd1e118">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov6-Hd1e120">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e122">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e124" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_3@19-19">Suscita.</quote>
            Non tantum ipse bene vivendo vigilare memento, sed illum, cui praees, a peccati torpore praedicando suscita.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov6-Dd1e129">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov6-Hd1e131">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e133">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e135" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_4@1-2">Ne dederis</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e138"><seg type="qs">somnum oculis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sed haec propter mentis taedium digna invectione non corrigit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov6-Dd1e147">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov6-Hd1e149">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e151">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e153" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_5@1-1">Eruere.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e156"><seg type="qs">Quasi dicat: Velut damula de manu captantis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et coelestis vitae pascua merearis intrare.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov6-Dd1e166">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov6-Hd1e168">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e170">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1089B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e174" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_6@1-3">Vade ad formicam.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e177"><seg type="qs">Hinc vacantem hortatur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">de horreo priscae actionis quod recondidit proferre.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov6-Dd1e186">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov6-Hd1e188">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e190">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e192" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_9@1-4">Usquequo, piger, dormies, quando.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e195"><seg type="qs">Usquequo, piger, dormies in vitiis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">hoc est enim quod sequitur, et <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e201" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_11@2-5">veniet tibi quasi viator.</quote></seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov6-Dd1e206">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov6-Hd1e208">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e210">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e212" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_11@6-8">Egestas, et paupertas.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e215"><seg type="qs">Patet juxta litteram</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quia improvisa et subitanea.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e223">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e225" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_11">Si vero impiger.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e230"><seg type="qs">Fructus terreni</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quia mercedem laborum indeficientem percipiet.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov6-Dd1e239">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov6-Hd1e241">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e243">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e245" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_12@1-2">Homo apostata.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e248"><seg type="qs">Dixerat de haeresi et aliis vitiorum generibus</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quod nulla interius radice subsistat.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov6-Dd1e257">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov6-Hd1e259">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e261">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e263" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_16@1-2">Sex sunt.</quote>
            De eodem quam sit odibilis Deo seminando discordiam insinuat.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e267">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1089C"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e271" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_16@8-9">Detestatur anima.</quote>
            Secundum consuetudinem hominum loquitur, ut eum valde tales odisse significet, unde in Isaia: <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e274" source="http://scta.info/resource/is1_14@4-8">Solemnitates vestras odivit anima mea</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov6-Dd1e279">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov6-Hd1e281">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e283">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e285" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_17@1-1">Oculos,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e288"><seg type="qs">Enumerat sex capitalia crimina</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">qui concordiam fraternae unitatis sciderunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov6-Dd1e298">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov6-Hd1e300">Versus 20</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e302">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e304" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_20@1-2">Conserva, fili.</quote>
            Nunc sub adulterae mulieris specie prohibet ab auditione haereseos.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov6-Dd1e309">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov6-Hd1e311">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e313">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e315" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_21@1-4">Liga ea in corde,</quote>
            id est, in cogitatione praecepta Dei fixa tene.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov6-Dd1e320">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov6-Hd1e322">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e324">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e326" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_22@1-2">Cum ambulaveris.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e329"><seg type="qs">Tanta sit meditatio divinae legis</seg>, etc., usque ad: <seg type="qs"><quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e334">gradiantur tecum mandata Dei, ut te instruant.</quote></seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e337">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e339" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_22@5-6">Cum dormieris:</quote>
            in morte custodiant animam <pb ed="#P" n="1089D"/> tuam, ne rapiat hostis. Cum evigilaveris in resurrectione, loquere cum eis exspectando praemia, quae tibi, si ea servasses, promissa erant.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov6-Dd1e346">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov6-Hd1e348">Versus 25</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e350">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e352" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_25@1-2">Non concupiscat.</quote>
            Patet de adultera, sed haeretici si bene vivere et apte se agere videntur, vide ne seducaris eorum doctrinis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov6-Dd1e357">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov6-Hd1e359">Versus 28</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e361">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e363" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_28">Pretium enim scorti.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e368"><seg type="qs">Brevis voluptas fornicationis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sed post paululum ardentior redit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov6-Dd1e377">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov6-Hd1e379">Versus 29</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e381">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e383" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_29">Nunquid potest homo abscondere ignem.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            Soli ei conceditur haereticorum libros legere, qui adeo solidatus est in fide catholica, ut verborum dulcedine vel astutia nequeat ab ea separari.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov6-Dd1e391">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov6-Hd1e393">Versus 30</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e395">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e397" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_30@1-4">Non grandis est culpa.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e400"><seg type="qs">Furtum non <pb ed="#P" n="1090A"/> ex se</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sed quia Jerusalem plura commisit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov6-Dd1e411">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov6-Hd1e413">Versus 34</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov6-d1e415">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e417" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov6_34@1-6">Quia zelus et furor viri non,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-prov6-Qd1e420"><seg type="qs">Et de Domino intelligendum est</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sive animam quamque fidelem corrumpere praesumit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
